{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35742","headline":"古意论交 · 李咸用","name":"古意论交","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"择友如淘金，沙尽不得宝。\n结交如乾银，产竭不成道。\n我生四十年，相识苦草草。\n多爲势利朋，少有岁寒操。\n通财能几何，闻善宁相告。\n茫然同夜行，中路自不保。\n常恐管鲍情，参差忽终老。\n今来既见君，青天无片云。\n语直瑟弦急，行高山桂芬。\n约我爲交友，不觉心醺醺。\n见义必许死，临危当指囷。\n无令後世士，重广孝标文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}